{"schema":"mao-cross-channel-public-site-data/1","script":"0183","rows":[{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0183:00000031:text","row":28606,"ordinal":1,"kind":"text","jp":"肩をすくめる。","en":"I shrug.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:ccc0014:00001","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0014:00001","en":"I shrug my shoulders.","verdict":"withheld","categories":[]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0183:0000005f:text","row":28607,"ordinal":2,"kind":"text","jp":"「やっぱりあったよ。要件」","en":"“Turns out I do have business here after all.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:011927","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0014:00002","en":"Taichi: \"But of course there is. Business, I mean.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0183:00000091:text","row":28608,"ordinal":3,"kind":"text","jp":"霧の目がせばめられる。忌々しげに。","en":"Kiri narrows her eyes, visibly annoyed.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:011928","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0014:00003","en":"Kiri's eyes narrowed. With resentful bitterness.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0183:000000d3:text","row":28609,"ordinal":4,"kind":"text","jp":"「美希君はいないのかな？」","en":"“Is Miki around?”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:011929","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0014:00004","en":"Taichi: \"Miki-kun's not around I guess?\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0183:00000128:text","row":28610,"ordinal":5,"kind":"text","jp":"「……いません」","en":"“...No.”","speakerJa":"霧","speakerEn":"Kiri","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:ccc0014:00005","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0014:00005","en":"Taichi: \"...she is not here.\"","verdict":"withheld","categories":[]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0183:00000158:text","row":28611,"ordinal":6,"kind":"text","jp":"「来てないの？」","en":"“She hasn’t come in?”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:011930","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0014:00006","en":"Taichi: \"Is she coming?\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0183:000001a3:text","row":28612,"ordinal":7,"kind":"text","jp":"「……いません」","en":"“...No.”","speakerJa":"霧","speakerEn":"Kiri","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:ccc0014:00007","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0014:00007","en":"Taichi: \"...she is not here.\"","verdict":"withheld","categories":[]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0183:000001cb:text","row":28613,"ordinal":8,"kind":"text","jp":"対話を細かに噛み合わせる気はないらしい。","en":"Apparently, she has no interest in keeping this conversation moving.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:011931","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0014:00008","en":"Her dialogue appears from clenched teeth that say all about her willingness to go over the details.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0183:0000020b:text","row":28614,"ordinal":9,"kind":"text","jp":"俺はまた肩をすくめた。","en":"I shrug again.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:011932","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0014:00009","en":"I shrugged my shoulders again.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0183:00000241:text","row":28615,"ordinal":10,"kind":"text","jp":"「とりつく島もないな」","en":"“You don't give a guy much to work with.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:011933","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0014:00010","en":"Taichi: \"No port in this storm then.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0183:00000292:text","row":28616,"ordinal":11,"kind":"text","jp":"「はい、ありません」","en":"“No. I don't.”","speakerJa":"霧","speakerEn":"Kiri","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:011934","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0014:00011","en":"Kiri: \"True, there is none.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0183:000002be:text","row":28617,"ordinal":12,"kind":"text","jp":"手近なイスに座る。","en":"I sit in the nearest chair.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:011935","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0014:00012","en":"I sit in a chair at hand.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0183:000002f0:text","row":28618,"ordinal":13,"kind":"text","jp":"「いやー、生理が重くてね。まったく憂鬱な時期だよ。ほら、人類滅亡してるし」","en":"“Man, my period’s brutal. What a miserable time of the month. Plus, humanity’s extinct.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:011936","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0014:00013","en":"Taichi: \"Reeeally, menses that harsh, mh. Damn if this isn't a depressing period of time! But come on, humanity has fallen.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0183:00000375:text","row":28619,"ordinal":14,"kind":"text","jp":"「……」","en":"“...”","speakerJa":"霧","speakerEn":"Kiri","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:ccc0014:00014","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0014:00014","en":"Kiri: \"...\"","verdict":"withheld","categories":[]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0183:00000395:text","row":28620,"ordinal":15,"kind":"text","jp":"じっと見ている。","en":"She stares.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:011937","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0014:00015","en":"A fixed stare towards me,","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0183:000003bd:text","row":28621,"ordinal":16,"kind":"text","jp":"俺の一挙一動を警戒している感じだ。","en":"She seems to be watching every move I make.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:011938","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0014:00016","en":"with the impression that she is being vigilant about every single action of mine.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0183:000003ff:text","row":28622,"ordinal":17,"kind":"text","jp":"「ミス・イノセンスはさー」","en":"“So, Miss Innocence—”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:011939","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0014:00017","en":"Taichi: \"Saaay, Miss Innocence.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0183:00000454:text","row":28623,"ordinal":18,"kind":"text","jp":"「人をそんな名前で呼ばないでください」","en":"“Please don’t call people names like that.”","speakerJa":"霧","speakerEn":"Kiri","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:011940","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0014:00018","en":"Kiri: \"Please do not call people by that name.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0183:0000049a:text","row":28624,"ordinal":19,"kind":"text","jp":"「霧ちんはさー」","en":"“So, Kiri-kins—”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:011941","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0014:00019","en":"Taichi: \"Saaay, Kiri-chin.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0183:000004e5:text","row":28625,"ordinal":20,"kind":"text","jp":"「馴れ馴れしく名前で呼ばないでください」","en":"“Please don’t address me so familiarly.”","speakerJa":"霧","speakerEn":"Kiri","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:011942","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0014:00020","en":"Kiri: \"Please do not call me in overly familiar ways.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0183:0000052d:text","row":28626,"ordinal":21,"kind":"text","jp":"「ふぅ」","en":"“Whew.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:011943","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0014:00021","en":"Taichi: \"Bofff.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0183:0000054d:text","row":28627,"ordinal":22,"kind":"text","jp":"肩をすくめた。三度目だ。","en":"I shrug—for the third time.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:011944","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0014:00022","en":"I shrugged my shoulders. Third time.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0183:00000585:text","row":28628,"ordinal":23,"kind":"text","jp":"「俺、すっごくいじめられちゃってるなぁ」","en":"“Wow. You’re really bullying me here.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:011945","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0014:00023","en":"Taichi: \"Me, I'm reaaally being teased a lot aren't I.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0183:000005e8:text","row":28629,"ordinal":24,"kind":"text","jp":"「……」","en":"“...”","speakerJa":"霧","speakerEn":"Kiri","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:ccc0014:00024","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0014:00024","en":"Kiri: \"...\"","verdict":"withheld","categories":[]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0183:00000608:text","row":28630,"ordinal":25,"kind":"text","jp":"席を立つ。","en":"I stand.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:011946","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0014:00025","en":"I stand from the seat.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0183:0000064d:text","row":28631,"ordinal":26,"kind":"text","jp":"「……っ」","en":"“...!”","speakerJa":"霧","speakerEn":"Kiri","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:011947","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0014:00026","en":"Kiri: \"...!\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0183:0000066f:text","row":28632,"ordinal":27,"kind":"text","jp":"警戒が強まる。","en":"Her guard goes up another notch.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:011948","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0014:00027","en":"Vigilance gains strength.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0183:00000695:text","row":28633,"ordinal":28,"kind":"text","jp":"ぞくっとした。","en":"A shiver runs through me.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:011949","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0014:00028","en":"She had goose bumps.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0183:000006bb:text","row":28634,"ordinal":29,"kind":"text","jp":"すげー可愛い。","en":"God, she’s cute.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:011950","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0014:00029","en":"How sooo cute.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0183:000006e1:text","row":28635,"ordinal":30,"kind":"text","jp":"サディスティックなマゾッホである俺は、こんなキャラにサティスファクション。","en":"A sadistic masochist like me finds this kind of character deeply sadisfying.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:011951","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0014:00030","en":"The sadistic Masoch that I am finds satisfaction in this character.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0183:0000074b:text","row":28636,"ordinal":31,"kind":"text","jp":"「ふふ……」","en":"“Heh...”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:011952","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0014:00031","en":"Taichi: \"Heheh...\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0183:00000792:text","row":28637,"ordinal":32,"kind":"text","jp":"「……？」","en":"“...?”","speakerJa":"霧","speakerEn":"Kiri","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:011953","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0014:00032","en":"Kiri: \"...?\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0183:000007b4:text","row":28638,"ordinal":33,"kind":"text","jp":"不敵に笑う俺。戸惑う霧。","en":"I grin defiantly. Kiri looks baffled.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:011954","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0014:00033","en":"I laugh fearlessly. Kiri becomes perplexed.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0183:000007e4:text","row":28639,"ordinal":34,"kind":"text","jp":"腰を落とし、いつでも逃げ出せる体勢だ。","en":"She crouches low, ready to bolt at any moment.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:011955","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0014:00034","en":"With a lowered waist, hers is a posture that allows running away at all times.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0183:00000822:text","row":28640,"ordinal":35,"kind":"text","jp":"俺はそのままわずかに移動し、とある席の前に立った。","en":"I sidle over to one particular desk and stop in front of it.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:011956","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0014:00035","en":"I just moved a bit like that, no sudden motions, and stood in front of a specific seat.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0183:00000874:text","row":28641,"ordinal":36,"kind":"text","jp":"「ここだっけ、霧の席」","en":"“This is your desk, right, Kiri?”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:011957","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0014:00036","en":"Taichi: \"If I remember right, this is your seat, Kiri.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0183:000008c5:text","row":28642,"ordinal":37,"kind":"text","jp":"「呼び捨てにしないでください……」","en":"“Please don’t call me by my first name...”","speakerJa":"霧","speakerEn":"Kiri","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:011958","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0014:00037","en":"Kiri: \"Please do not call me without honorific...\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0183:00000922:text","row":28643,"ordinal":38,"kind":"text","jp":"「……あなたの分際で」","en":"“Not from the likes of you.”","speakerJa":"霧","speakerEn":"Kiri","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:011959","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0014:00038","en":"Kiri: \"...remember your place in society.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0183:00000950:text","row":28644,"ordinal":39,"kind":"text","jp":"ナイフだった。","en":"A knife.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:011960","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0014:00039","en":"It was a knife.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0183:00000976:text","row":28645,"ordinal":40,"kind":"text","jp":"ぐさぐさと突き刺さる。","en":"Stab. Stab. Stab.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:011961","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0014:00040","en":"Piercing with slashes and thrusts.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0183:000009ac:text","row":28646,"ordinal":41,"kind":"text","jp":"「佐倉の席」","en":"“Sakura's desk.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:011962","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0014:00041","en":"Taichi: \"Your seat, Sakura.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0183:000009d0:text","row":28647,"ordinal":42,"kind":"text","jp":"ゆっくりとした動作で、座ろうとする。","en":"Very slowly, I start to sit.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:011963","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0014:00042","en":"With ponderated motions I go to sit.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0183:00000a2f:text","row":28648,"ordinal":43,"kind":"text","jp":"「やめて！」","en":"“Stop!”","speakerJa":"霧","speakerEn":"Kiri","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:011964","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0014:00043","en":"Kiri: \"STOP!\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0183:00000a53:text","row":28649,"ordinal":44,"kind":"text","jp":"切羽詰まった叫び。","en":"A desperate cry.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:011965","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0014:00044","en":"She shouts at the end of her wits.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0183:00000a7d:text","row":28650,"ordinal":45,"kind":"text","jp":"ぴたりと止める。","en":"I stop dead.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:011966","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0014:00045","en":"I stop on the dot.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0183:00000aad:text","row":28651,"ordinal":46,"kind":"text","jp":"「なぜだい？」","en":"“Why?”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:011967","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0014:00046","en":"Taichi: \"Why should I?\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0183:00000af6:text","row":28652,"ordinal":47,"kind":"text","jp":"「……汚れますから」","en":"“...You’ll get it dirty.”","speakerJa":"霧","speakerEn":"Kiri","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:011968","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0014:00047","en":"Kiri: \"...it will be filthied.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0183:00000b22:text","row":28653,"ordinal":48,"kind":"text","jp":"取り乱したのを恥じるような、ことさら低まった声。","en":"Her voice drops lower than ever, as though she is ashamed of losing control.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:011969","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0014:00048","en":"Her voice lowers deliberately, seemingly from the embarrassment at having lost composure.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0183:00000b72:text","row":28654,"ordinal":49,"kind":"text","jp":"「ふーん。じゃ仕方ない」","en":"“Oh well. Can’t be helped.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:011970","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0014:00049","en":"Taichi: \"Uh-huh. No helping it then.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0183:00000ba2:text","row":28655,"ordinal":50,"kind":"text","jp":"座った。","en":"I sit down.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:011971","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0014:00050","en":"I sat.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0183:00000be5:text","row":28656,"ordinal":51,"kind":"text","jp":"「あ―――」","en":"“Ah—”","speakerJa":"霧","speakerEn":"Kiri","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:011972","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0014:00051","en":"Kiri: \"AAAH!\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0183:00000c11:text","row":28657,"ordinal":52,"kind":"text","jp":"「いやー、あつはなついねぇ。のだおぶながだねぇ」","en":"“Man, it’s sot this hummer. Noda Obunaga.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:011973","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0014:00052","en":"Taichi: \"C'moon, Uranus is showing! I'll give you some dead batteries, free of charge!\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0183:00000c5f:text","row":28658,"ordinal":53,"kind":"text","jp":"「……」","en":"“...”","speakerJa":"霧","speakerEn":"Kiri","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:ccc0014:00053","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0014:00053","en":"Kiri: \"...\"","verdict":"withheld","categories":[]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0183:00000c87:text","row":28659,"ordinal":54,"kind":"text","jp":"「だんまり？」","en":"“Silent treatment?”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:011974","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0014:00054","en":"Taichi: \"Taciturn?\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0183:00000cad:text","row":28660,"ordinal":55,"kind":"text","jp":"霧の肩が震えていた。","en":"Kiri’s shoulders tremble.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:011975","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0014:00055","en":"Kiri's shoulders were trembling.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0183:00000cd9:text","row":28661,"ordinal":56,"kind":"text","jp":"そんなに悔しかったのか。","en":"Does it really gall her that much?","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:011976","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0014:00056","en":"Was it mortifying to that extent?","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0183:00000d09:text","row":28662,"ordinal":57,"kind":"text","jp":"ひどい嫌がりようだ。","en":"She really can’t stand it.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:011977","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0014:00057","en":"Hers seems like heartless hatred.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0183:00000d58:text","row":28663,"ordinal":58,"kind":"text","jp":"「何しに来たんですか」","en":"“What did you come here for?”","speakerJa":"霧","speakerEn":"Kiri","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:011978","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0014:00058","en":"Kiri: \"What did you come here for.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0183:00000d86:text","row":28664,"ordinal":59,"kind":"text","jp":"俺はにっこり微笑む。","en":"I give her a bright smile.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:011979","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0014:00059","en":"I smile brightly.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0183:00000dba:text","row":28665,"ordinal":60,"kind":"text","jp":"「ミス　イノセンスのイノセントな純潔だ」","en":"“Miss Innocence’s sweet, innocent chastity.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:011980","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0014:00060","en":"Taichi: \"For Miss Innocence's INOSENTO chastity.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0183:00000e1d:text","row":28666,"ordinal":61,"kind":"text","jp":"「……帰ってください」","en":"“...Please leave.”","speakerJa":"霧","speakerEn":"Kiri","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:011981","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0014:00061","en":"Kiri: \"...please go away.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0183:00000e53:text","row":28667,"ordinal":62,"kind":"text","jp":"「まだ何もしてないのに」","en":"“I haven't even done anything yet.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:011982","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0014:00062","en":"Taichi: \"But I still haven't done anything.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0183:00000ea6:text","row":28668,"ordinal":63,"kind":"text","jp":"「この上なにかする気なんですか？」","en":"“You’re planning to do even more?”","speakerJa":"霧","speakerEn":"Kiri","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:011983","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0014:00063","en":"Kiri: \"Do you have a mind of doing even more then?\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0183:00000ee8:text","row":28669,"ordinal":64,"kind":"text","jp":"「どーしようかなー」","en":"“Hmm. What should I do...?”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:011984","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0014:00064","en":"Taichi: \"Whaaa～t should I dooo～.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0183:00000f14:text","row":28670,"ordinal":65,"kind":"text","jp":"悩む。","en":"I agonize over it.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:011985","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0014:00065","en":"I worry.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0183:00000f32:text","row":28671,"ordinal":66,"kind":"text","jp":"ガラス細工に触れると指紋がついちゃう。","en":"If you touch a glass ornament, you leave fingerprints.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:011986","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0014:00066","en":"Touching the glasswork would leave fingerprints.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0183:00000f70:text","row":28672,"ordinal":67,"kind":"text","jp":"そんな逡巡。","en":"That is my dilemma.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:011987","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0014:00067","en":"That makes me hesitate.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0183:00000f9c:text","row":28673,"ordinal":68,"kind":"text","jp":"「うん、やめた」","en":"“Yeah, never mind.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:011988","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0014:00068","en":"Taichi: \"Fine, I'll stop.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0183:00000fca:text","row":28674,"ordinal":69,"kind":"text","jp":"「…………」","en":"“...”","speakerJa":"霧","speakerEn":"Kiri","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:011989","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0014:00069","en":"Kiri: \"......\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0183:00000fee:text","row":28675,"ordinal":70,"kind":"text","jp":"無視だった。","en":"She ignores me.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:011990","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0014:00070","en":"I was ignored.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0183:00001012:text","row":28676,"ordinal":71,"kind":"text","jp":"無視かナイフかだ。","en":"With her, it was either silence or knives.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:011991","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0014:00071","en":"Ignored maybe, a knife maybe.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0183:00001044:text","row":28677,"ordinal":72,"kind":"text","jp":"「世間話だけにしよう」","en":"“Let's stick to small talk.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:011992","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0014:00072","en":"Taichi: \"Let's just chat a bit.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0183:00001095:text","row":28678,"ordinal":73,"kind":"text","jp":"「帰ってください」","en":"“Please leave.”","speakerJa":"霧","speakerEn":"Kiri","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:011993","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0014:00073","en":"Kiri: \"Please go away.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0183:000010bf:text","row":28679,"ordinal":74,"kind":"text","jp":"肩をすくめた。四度目。","en":"I shrug for the fourth time.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:011994","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0014:00074","en":"I shrugged my shoulders. Fourth time.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0183:000010f5:text","row":28680,"ordinal":75,"kind":"text","jp":"「あ、授業道具持ってきてる」","en":"“Oh, you brought your class materials.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:011995","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0014:00075","en":"Taichi: \"Ah, you brought the classroom stuff with.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0183:00001129:text","row":28681,"ordinal":76,"kind":"text","jp":"霧の鞄の中身を勝手にあさる。","en":"I rummage through Kiri’s bag without asking.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:011996","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0014:00076","en":"I check the contents of Kiri's bag without permission.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0183:00001165:text","row":28682,"ordinal":77,"kind":"text","jp":"「今日は始業式だけだったの。ははーん、さては初日に持ってきた教科書を全部置きっぱなしにするタイプだな？」","en":"“But today was only the opening ceremony. Aha—you’re the type who brings in every textbook on the first day and then leaves them here.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:011997","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0014:00077","en":"Taichi: \"Today was nothing but opening ceremony though. Ah-ha, of course, you're the type that brings all the textbooks on the first day and leaves them here, aren't you?\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0183:00001208:text","row":28683,"ordinal":78,"kind":"text","jp":"「勝手に見ないでください。鞄に触れないでください」","en":"“Do not look through my things without permission. Do not touch my bag.”","speakerJa":"霧","speakerEn":"Kiri","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:011998","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0014:00078","en":"Kiri: \"Please do not look inside without permission. Please do not touch my bag.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0183:00001252:text","row":28684,"ordinal":79,"kind":"text","jp":"肩をすくめた。五回目。","en":"I shrug for the fifth time.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:011999","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0014:00079","en":"I shrugged my shoulders. Fifth time.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0183:00001280:text","row":28685,"ordinal":80,"kind":"text","jp":"肩すくませられっぱなしだ。","en":"She just keeps making me shrug.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:012000","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0014:00080","en":"Don't I just keep being made to shrug my shoulders.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0183:000012b2:text","row":28686,"ordinal":81,"kind":"text","jp":"さすが佐倉霧。","en":"That’s Kiri Sakura for you.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:012001","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0014:00081","en":"That's our Sakura Kiri for sure.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0183:000012d8:text","row":28687,"ordinal":82,"kind":"text","jp":"ミス　イノセンスの異名を持つ娘。","en":"The girl they called Miss Innocence.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:012002","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0014:00082","en":"The girl nicknamed Miss Innocence.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0183:00001318:text","row":28688,"ordinal":83,"kind":"text","jp":"「俺が何をしてもキミは傷つくんだな」","en":"“Everything I do hurts you, huh?”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:012003","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0014:00083","en":"Taichi: \"Whatever I do you just get hurt.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0183:0000135a:text","row":28689,"ordinal":84,"kind":"text","jp":"「……」","en":"“...”","speakerJa":"霧","speakerEn":"Kiri","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:ccc0014:00084","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0014:00084","en":"Kiri: \"...\"","verdict":"withheld","categories":[]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0183:00001382:text","row":28690,"ordinal":85,"kind":"text","jp":"「疲れない？」","en":"“Doesn't it wear you out?”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:012004","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0014:00085","en":"Taichi: \"Aren't you tired?\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0183:000013cb:text","row":28691,"ordinal":86,"kind":"text","jp":"「誰の……せいだと……」","en":"“Whose... fault do you think...?”","speakerJa":"霧","speakerEn":"Kiri","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:012005","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0014:00086","en":"Kiri: \"Whose fault... would that be...\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0183:000013fb:text","row":28692,"ordinal":87,"kind":"text","jp":"声が震えた。怒りのため。","en":"Her voice trembles with anger.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:012006","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0014:00087","en":"Her voice was shaking. Because of anger.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0183:0000142b:text","row":28693,"ordinal":88,"kind":"text","jp":"いつもはもっと素っ気ないのに、さすが人類滅亡。","en":"Normally she is far more aloof. Humanity’s extinction has really done a number on her.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:012007","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0014:00088","en":"Her Always is much more curt, indeed it's gotta be the Fall of Mankind.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0183:00001471:text","row":28694,"ordinal":89,"kind":"text","jp":"霧もかなり動揺して、心の壁が揺らいでいるようだ。","en":"Even Kiri is rattled; the walls around her heart are starting to give.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:012008","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0014:00089","en":"Kiri herself is trembling considerably, as if the wall around her heart was growing unstable.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0183:000014c1:text","row":28695,"ordinal":90,"kind":"text","jp":"「俺のせいかもね」","en":"“Maybe it is my fault.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:012009","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0014:00090","en":"Taichi: \"That'd be my fault, right.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0183:000014eb:text","row":28696,"ordinal":91,"kind":"text","jp":"くすくす笑う。","en":"I chuckle under my breath.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:012010","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0014:00091","en":"I giggle.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0183:00001511:text","row":28697,"ordinal":92,"kind":"text","jp":"肩をすくめる。","en":"I shrug.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:ccc0014:00092","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0014:00092","en":"I shrug my shoulders.","verdict":"withheld","categories":[]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0183:00001537:text","row":28698,"ordinal":93,"kind":"text","jp":"カクカクと高速ですくめては弛緩しすくめては弛緩し、コミカルな動き。","en":"Then I start shrugging and relaxing, shrugging and relaxing at high speed—a ridiculous mechanical twitch.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:012011","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0014:00093","en":"I wobbled as I relaxed by shrugging at high speed, then relax from that with a shrug, a comical motion.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0183:000015b4:text","row":28699,"ordinal":94,"kind":"text","jp":"「……出ていって……くれますか」","en":"“...Would you... please leave?”","speakerJa":"霧","speakerEn":"Kiri","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:012012","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0014:00094","en":"Kiri: \"...won't you please... leave now.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0183:000015ec:text","row":28700,"ordinal":95,"kind":"text","jp":"激昂したいのを必死でこらえていた。","en":"She is fighting desperately not to explode.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:012013","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0014:00095","en":"She's frantically trying to bear her own exasperation.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0183:0000162e:text","row":28701,"ordinal":96,"kind":"text","jp":"「……ハヒ」","en":"“...Yesh.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:012014","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0014:00096","en":"Taichi: \"...YESH.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0183:00001652:text","row":28702,"ordinal":97,"kind":"text","jp":"怒らせすぎた。","en":"I’ve pushed her too far.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:012015","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0014:00097","en":"I made her too angry,","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0183:00001678:text","row":28703,"ordinal":98,"kind":"text","jp":"立ち去るとしよう。","en":"Time to go.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:012016","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0014:00098","en":"it's time to depart.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0183:000016aa:text","row":28704,"ordinal":99,"kind":"text","jp":"「あ、ねえ、昼ご飯一緒に食べない？」","en":"“Oh, hey—want to have lunch together?”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:012017","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0014:00099","en":"Taichi: \"Ah, say, can't we eat lunch together?","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0183:000016e6:text","row":28705,"ordinal":100,"kind":"text","jp":"霧はきょとんとした。","en":"Kiri blinks at me.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:012018","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0014:00100","en":"Kiri stares in blank amazement.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0183:0000171a:text","row":28706,"ordinal":101,"kind":"text","jp":"「……ダメか。じゃあね。美希ちんによろしく」","en":"“...No? Okay, bye. Give Miki-kins my best.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:ccc0014:00101","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0014:00101","en":"Taichi: \"...not happening then. Bye then. Sends my best regards to Miki-chin.\"","verdict":"withheld","categories":[]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0183:0000175e:text","row":28707,"ordinal":102,"kind":"text","jp":"教室を出たのだった。","en":"And with that, I leave the classroom.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:012019","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0014:00102","en":"And that's when I left the classroom.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]}]}
